2026-07-27T11:48:27.0976150Z i /tmp/RtmpDLalW7/duckdb
2026-07-27T11:48:27.0976583Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T11:48:27.0977361Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T11:48:27.0977905Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T11:48:27.0978603Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T11:48:27.0979971Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T11:48:27.0980961Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
